{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112401","id":2978642518,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6xinpW","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112401","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112401.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112401.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112401","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112401/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112401/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112401/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/63d131967482bc81e1d50e25881e4cace2da4e9e","number":112401,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix crash on queue free scene node in editor","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- *Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112171*\r\n\r\n## Issue Description\r\n\r\nWhen we try to delete scene root node using `queue_free` in editor, we will meet a crash. The marked node will be freed defer. But the editor still want to redraw relevant plugins for scene root node, then crashed.\r\n\r\nIt is an abnormal behavior to **delete** a node in editor in `@tool` annotated gdscript. If we delete a child node, we will see the child node disappeared from left `EditorTreeDock` menu. If we delete the root node, the scene cannot display normally.\r\n\r\n```\r\n# First, enable gdscript running in editor\r\n@tool\r\nextends Node2D\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\t# Second, queue free scene root node \r\n\tqueue_free()\r\n```\r\n\r\n## MRP\r\n\r\n[112171-1.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23349138/112171-1.zip)\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nProhibit  `queue_clear` to delete scene root node in editor.\r\n\r\n[queue-free.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d05e7ce0-37b9-486d-a867-ccc5c5456f64)\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","description":"","color":"885544","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.gi